OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FShowers across most areas,
OL,6,Fthese most frequent during the morning
OL,7,Fand over northern areas and
OL,8,Foccasionally turning wintry.
OL,9,FTemperatures seasonally low given the
OL,10,Fgenerally northerly breezes.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FTuesday brings periods of rain and
OL,14,Fhill snow, which turns heavy at times.
OL,15,FWednesday rather cloudy with some
OL,16,Fpatchy rain.Thursday frosty, dry and
OL,17,Fbright in south, with showers in north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
